OL,3,AUrine test can spot more than nine in
OL,4,A10 bladder cancers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn at-home urine test that the NHS has
OL,7,Fbeen trialling can detect more than
OL,8,Fnine in ten cases of bladder cancer,
OL,9,Flatest findings show.
OL,11,FThe study, published in European
OL,12,FUrology Oncology, was led by the
OL,13,FUniversity of Birmingham and a
OL,14,Fdiagnostics company Nonacus, and
OL,15,Finvolved nearly 1,000 patients at seven
OL,16,Fhospitals in England and Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
