OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUrine test can spot more than nine in
OL,4,A10 bladder cancers
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers hope it could reduce the
OL,7,Fnumber of patients needing urgent, more
OL,8,Finvasive procedures, called
OL,9,Fcystoscopies, which involve inserting a
OL,10,Fsmall camera up the urethra and into
OL,11,Fthe bladder.
OL,13,FIf a larger trial is successful, it
OL,14,Fcould mean tens of thousands of
OL,15,Fpatients a year are spared these tests.
